		{
			description: ["This chapter lays out GregTech Circuit Progression. Circuits are unlocked in groups based on what type of technology is used in their construction. For example, the first type of circuit you will make are Electronic circuits, and Integrated circuits after that. As a general rule, each circuit type of any technology group requires one or multiple of the previous ones in its recipe. The rows represent these technology groups, while the columns correspond to which voltage tier a circuit belongs. This means that the &lbottom circuit of each column&r is the most cost efficient one that you can make."]
